# The hero for sikemux.com, taken by the site's `pnpm shots`: the storefront agent's chat beside
# its desk's browser on the store's checkout page, served on localhost, with the world's picture
# behind the panes.
window 1760 900
replies replies.json
prefer themeId aura-noir
serve 5173 pages/storefront
project storefront shop
patch site-fix.diff
chat Wren
title "Cart totals a cent off"
settle 6
click 871,774
type "Some orders come out a cent off at checkout. Find out why and fix it properly, with a test." 200
key enter
hold 22
wait 0.5
type "Good. Run all the tests, commit it, then open the checkout so I can see the total." 200
key enter
hold 16
wait 1
# The strip starts on its first tab, this chat's, and the pointer rests on the empty top bar.
cursor 700,59
pan 4000,0 0.3
cursor 1300,20
wait 0.5
snap hero
